WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:05.230
<b>Episode 14: The Knight, Sorano Hanako</b>

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:06.490
Now, I'll grant whoever wins the power 
of the Mythic Beast Knight, Invincible.

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:07.560
Got it?

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:08.570
Yes.

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:08.570
Yes.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.610
<i>I can beat her in close combat!</i>

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.070
<i>I can keep him away 
and win at this distance!</i>

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:18.860
<i>She's fast!</i>

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:26.300
<i>Every hit is strong! But!</i>

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.360
<i>I can't get close to her 
if I cower away from this!</i>

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.630
<i>Ignore the damage!</i>

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:37.600
<i>What those two went through 
was way worse than this!</i>

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.880
<i>What's wrong, Yuuhi?</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:47.560
<i>You're not focusing on the battle.</i>

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:02.870
<i>Shinonome-san, I'm sorry.</i>

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:08.060
<i>You gave me power, 
but I wasn't able to protect a friend!</i>

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.980
<i>I'm sorry, Kusakabe-kun. 
I couldn't save you!</i>

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:16.230
Damn it!

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:23.470
<i>Yuuhi's not acting like himself today.</i>

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:29.390
All settled?

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:33.690
What's that bag?!

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:44.290
Sia!

00:01:46.490 --> 00:01:49.290
This is what Invincible looks like?

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:54.940
Amamiya-kun.

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:02.390
I love you.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:10.230
So I'll stop you two.

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:19.770
Yuuhi...

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:41.520
<i>When I looked up, 
that sky was full of wonders.</i>

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:46.820
<i>The despair I bottled up tormented me,</i>

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:50.790
<i>and I wanted the courage 
to break my chains of isolation.</i>

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:52.060
<i>(You are my light)</i>

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:57.650
<i>I was searching for your 
brilliant light in my hazy dreams</i>

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:01.950
<i>to kick away the limits placed on myself.</i>

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:06.910
<i>Now with your courage, 
let's soar into the sky.</i>

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:09.620
<i>Let's CRUSH the fear!</i>

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:14.760
<i>I swear to you, at the ends 
of this chaotic world,</i>

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:17.300
<i>that even if you fall, I'll</i>

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.850
<i>Be the HERO!</i>

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:25.030
<i>I'll be waiting at the future 
we're moving toward,</i>

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:28.920
<i>with a “YES, MY LORD!” 
for your constant radiance,</i>

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:32.990
<i>clutching the stars raining down upon us.</i>

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:40.610
<i>I'll love you until we reach 
that future you want to destroy.</i>

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:19.620
Hanako. It's not like you 
to vent your anger on things.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:32.970
Looks like it's going to rain.

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:35.470
Hanako, you should bring an umbrella.

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:46.240
Bad weather today.

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:48.650
Hm? Yeah.

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:53.470
It would better to take it easy indoors.

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:55.940
Hm? Yeah.

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:59.610
<i>Did yesterday's loss hit him that hard?</i>

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:06.020
<i>And what does he think 
about Hakudou's confession?</i>

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:07.990
<i>He hasn't said a word since yesterday.</i>

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:15.920
Y-Yuuhi!

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:20.790
How could you fall 
into a hole you dug yourself?!

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:29.460
Now it's raining.

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:31.560
Hmm?

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.870
Mikazuki!

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:36.130
Hey, Yuu-kun, Neu.

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:37.700
What are you doing?

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:39.810
Bu...

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:41.540
Bu?

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:43.540
Bury me!

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:47.140
You heard him. Please do it.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.480
Uh...

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:52.150
Bury me. Please.

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:53.760
Jeez.

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:57.500
You look pathetic.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.630
Did you lose your wallet or something?

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:03.000
Well, something like that.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:06.220
You're something else. 
Want me to lend you some money?

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:08.220
No, I'm fine.

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:10.370
Then, let's get drunk and forget about it!

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:12.100
For snacks we've got Ta—

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:30.090
You two should both go home today.

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:31.650
You'll catch a cold.

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:36.970
Well, then.

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:37.700
Yeah.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:39.430
Hm?

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:41.250
What?

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:53.240
Sh-Shinonome-dono!

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:56.270
But in that battle I saw you d—

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.440
Wha?! Mikazuki?!

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:13.070
Animus! You've gone too far this time!

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:17.580
A g—

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:18.620
A golem!

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:24.410
This one has eleven eyes.

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:28.550
Eleven?! We haven't haven't even 
defeated the ninth or tenth yet!

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:33.010
You should have met the tenth, 
Pyanepsion, already.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.470
It spoke?!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:36.930
<i>We already met it?! Was it—</i>

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:43.550
Now it's transforming 
into the Princess! And it's naked!

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:44.230
Mikazuki!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.520
Run!

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:49.810
Tch, fine, then!

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:53.060
Even if we know it's not her, 
it's still hard to fight that form.

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:55.950
You haven't seen the last of me, you bastard!

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:08.630
I told you to bring 
an umbrella this morning.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.920
It's a warrior's job 
to take care of their health.

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:18.850
I'm not saying this just 
because I forgot my umbrella,

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:21.770
but it's fun to walk through 
the rain empty-handed, right?

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:24.460
Feels good to get as soaked as you wa—

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:30.420
Hanako, at least ride your bicycle.

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:31.640
You'll catch a cold.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:36.620
<i>A shape-shifting golem?</i>

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:37.910
Yes.

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:41.520
<i>At any rate, let's contact everyone 
and decide on a code word</i>

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:44.110
<i>so we can tell it apart if it 
transforms into one of us.</i>

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:49.600
There might be no point to that 
if it reads their minds and then transforms.

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:52.720
Let's verify each other 
by displaying our holding fields.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.300
<i>All right. Let's go with that.</i>

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.140
<i>Later.</i>

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:58.050
I'll contact Sorano-san, first.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:01.640
She's the one we're worried 
about most right now.

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:15.650
What's the matter? You look pale.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.010
Are you okay?

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:25.280
There's a bench under that roof over there.

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:26.260
Let's take a break.

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:28.780
Hanako, get a hold of yourself!

00:09:28.780 --> 00:09:30.330
It's a trap from Animus!

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:32.000
Kusakabe Tarou is already...

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:41.390
Have you calmed down?

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:48.600
Ow.

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:54.650
Why are you crying, Tarou-kun?

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:58.660
B-Because it hurts!

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.810
Even though I'm the one who fell?

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.700
That's so weird.

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:08.060
Come on, you're not the one who got hurt!

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:12.100
Pain, pain, uh... go away!

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:12.700
Hey!

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:13.260
Ow!

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:15.170
Papa.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:17.280
What are you doing, bullying Tarou-kun?

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:19.320
I'm not bullying him.

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:22.790
<i>Tarou-kun always cried first.</i>

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:24.600
<i>Tarou-kun showed his pain.</i>

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:25.670
Hmm?

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:27.450
That looks painful. Are you okay?

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:30.440
It hurts! It does hurt!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:33.360
<i>Ever since then, little by little...</i>

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:34.660
It doesn't hurt.

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:37.150
<i>...he stole my pain.</i>

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:39.350
You girls go elsewhere!

00:10:39.350 --> 00:10:42.160
We're the ones who claimed this spot first!

00:10:42.430 --> 00:10:43.880
What's wrong with you boys?!

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:45.110
You're being greedy!

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:47.370
This park belongs to everyone!

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:50.080
Tarou-kun, let's go play!

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:51.500
Huh?! Ah...

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:53.390
Tarou, are you planning to betray us?

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:57.550
Y-You girls go elsewhere!

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:03.640
Hanako...

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:04.600
I'm sorry.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:05.980
It's fine. Whatever.

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:08.430
Are you still mad?

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:12.990
Don't cry. I'm not mad anymore.

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:14.270
Really?

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:17.230
See? Let's go home!

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:29.330
Oh, what's up, Tarou?

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.280
Hana-chan leading you around again?

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:33.010
You're like her little brother.

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:36.880
I guess Hana-chan's 
the reliable older sister then.

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:38.140
Yeah!

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:39.340
Huh?

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:41.130
Come on, let's go.

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:46.010
<b>Root Veg</b>

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:46.520
<i>I was crybaby Tarou's reliable older sister.</i>

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:48.720
Somewhere Middle School
Entrance Ceremony

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:49.000
<i>I knew everything about Tarou,</i>

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.990
<i>and I had to look out for him.</i>

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:53.180
<i>Or so I thought.</i>

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.320
I don't get it.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:58.530
You're going to the same 
school as me, right?

00:11:58.530 --> 00:11:59.690
Come on, try harder.

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:01.570
A-All right.

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:05.530
I wonder if I'll be looking after you 
when we go to college, too.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:08.240
Oh, I'm not going to college.

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.930
Huh? Then what are you doing?

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:15.290
Once I graduate high school, I'm going to 
technical school to get my cooking license.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:19.170
I want to be a chef.

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:22.420
When did you start planning that?

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:25.430
Well, your place used to 
be a restaurant, right?

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:27.680
Your dad's doing something else there now,

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:30.300
but that's always kind of been 
in the back of my mind.

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:32.610
It has?

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:35.100
<b>Faculty Office</b>

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:35.100
<b>Midterm Examination Results</b>

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:36.560
<b>Yamada         Ichirou</b>

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:36.560
<b>Umida             Jirou</b>

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:36.560
<b>Sorano          Hanako</b>

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:36.560
<b>Kawahashi        Michio</b>

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:39.340
Hanako, you're in third!
That's incredible!

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:40.440
Is it?

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:43.720
It is incredible! I'm in 204th place!

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:47.390
It's not incredible.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:50.330
Oh, I need to go to the library.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.750
They said they got 
the cookbook I requested came in.

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:57.630
Sorano, you haven't submitted 
your plans for the future.

00:12:58.990 --> 00:13:00.670
Are you still debating them?

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:02.780
Just put down higher education for now.

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:05.060
I don't have any specific 
vision for my future.

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:08.910
<i>He stole away more than just my pain.</i>

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:12.660
<i>No, I was likely...</i>

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:14.200
<i>being left behind.</i>

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:17.660
<i>I used to smile for my crybaby Tarou,</i>

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:21.940
<i>but as I watched him smile, I forgot how to.</i>

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:24.990
<i>But crybaby Tarou is no longer here.</i>

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:29.330
<i>All that's left is an aimless, 
four-eyed studyholic.</i>

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.190
<i>But that's fine.</i>

00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:34.180
<i>My little brother let go of my hand.</i>

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:38.110
<i>Now I'll have to slowly regain my emotions...</i>

00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:39.830
Hey, Hanako!

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:43.630
<i>...and express them for myself.</i>

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:45.590
<i>Then one day...</i>

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:48.050
It's so good!

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:51.380
Feels like I just saw you smile 
for the first time in a long while.

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:52.260
Really?

00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:57.970
<i>I want to be his equal.</i>

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:04.480
You don't resemble him at all, impostor.

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:11.790
Hanako! All right, attack!

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:13.450
You be quiet for a bit.

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:16.710
You won't fight me?

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:20.470
If that was your intention, 
I'd be long dead by now.

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:21.920
Besides...

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:25.540
Thank you. I think I've got 
my feelings in order now.

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:28.460
He left me behind,

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.440
and now he's gone.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.830
How boring.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:36.970
The lizard and the crow 
made such a big deal, too.

00:14:36.970 --> 00:14:38.060
Guess I'll go home.

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:39.270
Golem!

00:14:43.140 --> 00:14:44.350
Farewell.

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:48.250
<i>Next time, let's meet on the battlefield.</i>

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:53.900
It's here!

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:57.200
Tsukishiro

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:15.720
It's showdown time! 
We're taking it down here and now!

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:22.950
The Beast Knights are all in mourning attire?

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:25.820
I'm happy that we all were 
thinking the same thing.

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:28.000
Sou-chan, where's Hanako-chan?

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:29.550
I told her not to come.

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:30.900
I can't let her fight yet.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:34.370
Tch. Avenging him 
without his prime mourner?

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:37.370
The Princess is unable to move after 
making a new Mythic Beast Knight again.

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:40.420
Hanako...

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:43.080
It's all right. I'm going.

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:46.420
I finally found it.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:51.010
For now, I know what I want to do.

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:55.940
I'm done being a studyholic.

00:15:55.940 --> 00:15:57.640
<i>From today on...</i>

00:15:58.330 --> 00:15:59.520
I'm a warrior.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:03.600
<i>If I'm able to make it back alive,</i>

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:04.560
<i>then, yes...</i>

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:09.250
I'll start with a rice omelet 
first, Tarou-kun.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:20.500
Those mini golems again!

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:22.190
Please be careful!

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:24.080
Those things are likely the tenth golem!

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:26.590
What?! But there're so many!

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:29.050
If we've already encountered it, 
then it has to be these things!

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:31.130
Those things don't learn, do they?!

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:33.850
I'll lead the charge!

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:34.520
Sia!

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:35.220
Yeah.

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:36.150
Dance!

00:16:36.150 --> 00:16:37.000
Yeah.

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:38.980
Invincible!

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.650
Unicorn!

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:48.730
Invincible?!

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:50.360
Another Mystic Beast Knight!

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:52.070
I'll mow them down at once!

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:55.050
Here we come, nine-eyes! Prepare yourself!

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.280
Hey.

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:06.500
Are you looking for me?

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:08.790
Yes. I have a request.

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:14.130
Depends on what it is. So?

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:17.520
Let me fight the nine-eyes one-on-one.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:21.680
Holding Field: Myriad Headed Orochi!

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:25.420
You want to fight Boedromion?

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:26.830
Hmm...

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:28.650
I can have it come here later.

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:30.460
Thank you.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:34.320
I look forward to an entertaining show.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:37.430
I don't know if it'll live up 
to your expectations.

00:17:49.970 --> 00:17:51.820
What a monster!

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:55.760
I can't believe it's holding its own 
against two Mythic Beast Knights at once.

00:17:55.760 --> 00:18:00.570
It looks like it won't go down unless 
we damage its shield, spear, or legs.

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:01.840
Yeah.

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:03.920
I'll jump and draw its attention.

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:05.340
You handle the rest.

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:06.260
Yeah.

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:12.210
<i>Tarou... Here I go!</i>

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:15.900
Aerial Domain: Halberd Army!

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:36.250
Halberd!

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:38.390
Pierce it! Mittwoch!

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:50.790
It's faltering!

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:52.400
It's slower to move its shield!

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:58.340
Unstoppable Spear!

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:14.960
It's finished! Everyone focus fire!

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:21.070
Hoohoo. Why don't you join in, too?

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:22.640
I know!

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:25.350
Shall I teach you how to swim?

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:26.450
<i>I'm fine.</i>

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:28.530
<i>Then, let's go play where 
you can still stand.</i>

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:30.060
<i>I said I'm fine.</i>

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:36.820
What?!

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:38.780
Shit!

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:40.370
We can't let it escape!

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:41.740
Everyone, after it!

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:48.790
Welcome.

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:58.000
Now, die.

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:03.230
Special attacks have to have a name!

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:07.010
Holding Field:

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:12.480
(The Hero's Sword) Kusakabe!

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:14.690
<i>Tarou-kun, watch me.</i>

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:32.000
That's it!

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.520
I absolutely hate you.

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:36.420
Go!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:38.550
So don't you dare die.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.840
Go! Hanako!

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:48.010
Yes, wonderful!

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:51.530
That's attack power on par 
with the Dog Knight.

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:09.810
I love you.

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:51.040
Shinonome-dono and Akitani-dono 
were both admirable people,

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:53.760
but Kusakabe Tarou

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:57.010
was a boy everyone loved.

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:03.220
By losing the one she loved,

00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:07.580
she's already paid off the karma 
of wishing for another's death.

00:22:09.920 --> 00:22:10.930
Don't cry.

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:14.120
Kusakabe Tarou did well.

00:22:19.090 --> 00:22:22.900
Sorano, you're giving up on college 
and going for cooking school instead

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:25.910
this late in the year?

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:29.110
Are you trying to do it for Kusakabe?

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:32.080
No, it's because I want to.

00:22:33.150 --> 00:22:35.410
I see. Work hard, then.

00:22:35.410 --> 00:22:36.470
Will do!

00:22:40.480 --> 00:22:43.550
<i>September came to a close 
and October was upon us.</i>

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:47.800
<i>Summer was over.</i>

00:24:22.440 --> 00:24:27.440
<b>Next Episode:
Amamiya Yuuhi and the Shinonome Brothers</b>
